RD(1)- 269; 
 যেহেতু direct speech এ universal truth বোঝাচ্ছে তাই indirect speech এ tense এর কোন পরিবর্তন হবে না। তবে যেহেতু reporting speech এ object the students তাই reported speechএর you Indirect speech এ object, the students অনুযায়ী they তে পরিণত হবে।
 Direct speech: The teacher said to the students, “The more you read, the more you learn.”  Indirect speech: The teacher said to the students that the more they read, the more they learn.

